<<set $AgarwalUncle_Path = "a">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Enthusiastic">>
Raju: I want to master inventory management, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Eager">>
Raju: Help me understand your system for tracking stock.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: For organizing products and knowing when to reorder supplies.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Skeptical">>
AgarwalUncle: Inventory management? Beta, this isn't organizing your school books.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
AgarwalUncle: Mistakes in inventory mean lost sales.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Worried">>
AgarwalUncle: Unhappy customers, and wasted money on products that don't sell.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: I understand the responsibility, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: But I'm systematic and detail-oriented.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Eager">>
Raju: I want to learn how successful businesses maintain perfect organization.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Curious">>
Raju: Even with hundreds of different items.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Doubtful">>
AgarwalUncle: You really think you can handle tracking inventory?

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Challenging">>
AgarwalUncle: Understanding how each item moves, when to restock?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Yes, uncle! I'll study your system carefully.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Respectful">>
Raju: And I won't make any changes without your approval.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Cautious">>
AgarwalUncle: Very well. But you start with basic counting and organizing only.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Stern">>
AgarwalUncle: No ordering decisions until you prove you understand.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
AgarwalUncle: How inventory affects cash flow and customer satisfaction.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Overjoyed">>
Raju: Thank you for trusting me, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I'll be the most careful and systematic assistant you've ever had.

<<jump AgarwalUncle_Day3_Continue>>
===

