---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite GeneralStore>>

After yesterday's selection, Raju arrives early to begin implementing his chosen approach before the evening rush tests his abilities.

The store welcomes Raju's early arrival. The morning calm provides ideal conditions for beginning without peak pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Testing">>
AgarwalUncle: Ready for your first real day of retail work, beta?

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Challenging">>
AgarwalUncle: Today you'll discover whether your enthusiasm can handle actual demands.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
AgarwalUncle: Of serving customers and managing business operations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I'm completely ready, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I've been thinking about this opportunity all night.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: I'm eager to prove that my help can make a genuine difference.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Cautious">>
AgarwalUncle: We'll see how you handle the pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Stern">>
AgarwalUncle: When customers want fast service and perfect accuracy simultaneously.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
AgarwalUncle: Retail work tests both your skills and your character under stress.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Respectful">>
Raju: I understand, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Hopeful">>
Raju: But I believe that helping your business succeed will teach me valuable lessons.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Thoughtful">>
Raju: About precision, customer relations, and the importance of small enterprises.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Approving">>
AgarwalUncle: Your attitude is promising, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Expectant">>
AgarwalUncle: Now let's see if your performance matches your commitment.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Businesslike">>
AgarwalUncle: The evening rush starts in two hours.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Energized">>
Raju: Then let's use these two hours to prepare perfectly!

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Pleased">>
AgarwalUncle: Good thinking. Come, let me show you the critical details.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Instructive">>
AgarwalUncle: The ones that separate adequate service from excellent service.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Eager">>
Raju: I'm ready to learn everything, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Encouraging">>
AgarwalUncle: Your enthusiasm is refreshing, beta. Let's put it to work.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Serious">>
AgarwalUncle: Remember - accuracy first, then speed. Never the other way around.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Focused">>
Raju: Accuracy first, then speed. Got it, uncle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Satisfied">>
AgarwalUncle: You're learning already. Now let's begin.

<<HideCharacter>>

As pre-evening preparation intensifies, both understand the next few hours will provide definitive evidence of whether his assistance represents genuine value.

