With two successful days behind him, Raju approaches Agarwal Uncle about making their arrangement more formal and discussing what this experience has taught him.

The store atmosphere reflects their comfortable working relationship. Today's conversation carries weight beyond immediate business concerns.

<<SetCharacterExpression "AgarwalUncle" "Reflective">>
